{"v": 1, "key": "cu-cu04", "cards": [{"id": "u3.t.binary-fission", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term mid\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">BI<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">na<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">ry<\/span> <span class=\"st\">FIS<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">sion<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"binary fission\" data-tts=\"1\" aria-label=\"Listen: binary fission\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"binary fission\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"63.5\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Copy DNA<\/text><line x1=\"59.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"73.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"73.0,60.0 68.5,62.2 68.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"74\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"52.3\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Cell<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"63.5\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">grows<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"74.7\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">longer<\/text><line x1=\"127.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"141.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"141.0,60.0 136.5,62.2 136.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"142\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"168\" y=\"47.85\" font-size=\"9.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Splits<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"58.05\" font-size=\"9.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">into two<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"68.25\" font-size=\"9.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">identical<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"78.45\" font-size=\"9.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">cells<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">How a bacterium reproduces: it copies its DNA, grows, and splits into two identical cells.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>二分裂<\/b>：细菌的繁殖方式：复制 DNA，长大后分裂成两个相同的细胞。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">binary = two, fission = splitting.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">binary = 二，fission = 分裂。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: How many cells result from one round of binary fission?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Two.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u3.t.conjugation", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term mid\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">con<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">ju<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">GA<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">tion<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"conjugation\" data-audio=\"audio/conjugation.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: conjugation\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"conjugation\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><ellipse cx=\"45\" cy=\"60\" rx=\"32\" ry=\"20\" class=\"f1 k\"/><ellipse cx=\"155\" cy=\"60\" rx=\"32\" ry=\"20\" class=\"f2 k\"/><line x1=\"77\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"123\" y2=\"60\" class=\"k\"/><circle cx=\"52\" cy=\"60\" r=\"5\" class=\"f5\"/><line x1=\"58.0\" y1=\"52.0\" x2=\"110.0\" y2=\"52.0\"/><polygon points=\"110.0,52.0 105.5,54.2 105.5,49.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><circle cx=\"148\" cy=\"60\" r=\"5\" class=\"f5\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">DNA copy passes through the pilus<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">Two bacteria join by a pilus and pass DNA, such as a plasmid, from one to the other.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>接合<\/b>：两个细菌通过菌毛连接，把一段 DNA（如质粒）从一个传给另一个。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">con- = together, jugum = yoke. Joined together.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">con- = 一起，jugum = 轭：连在一起。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Is conjugation reproduction?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">No. It swaps DNA, but does not make new cells.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u3.t.endospore", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">EN<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">do<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">spore<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"endospore\" data-tts=\"1\" aria-label=\"Listen: endospore\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><figure class=\"photo\"><img src=\"photos/u3-endospore.webp\" width=\"500\" height=\"375\" alt=\"Bacillus subtilis under a microscope: the green-blue ovals inside the pink rods are endospores (bar = 10 micrometres).\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Bacillus subtilis under a microscope: the green-blue ovals inside the pink rods are endospores (bar = 10 micrometres).<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">显微镜下的枯草芽孢杆菌：粉色杆状细胞里的蓝绿色椭圆就是内生孢子（比例尺 = 10 微米）。<\/span><small class=\"cred\">Photo: Y tambe (original uploader) · <a href=\"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/\" rel=\"license noopener\">CC BY-SA 3.0<\/a> · <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bacillus_subtilis_Spore.jpg\" rel=\"noopener\">Wikimedia Commons<\/a><\/small><\/figcaption><\/figure><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"endospore\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><ellipse cx=\"100\" cy=\"55\" rx=\"70\" ry=\"28\" class=\"f1 k\"/><ellipse cx=\"100\" cy=\"55\" rx=\"20\" ry=\"12\" class=\"f7 k\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"58\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">spore<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"105\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">survives heat and dryness<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"14\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">inside the cell<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">A tough, dormant form some bacteria make to survive heat, dryness and chemicals.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>内生孢子<\/b>：部分细菌形成的坚韧休眠体，可耐受高温、干燥和化学物质。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">endo = inside. Spore formed inside.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">endo = 内部。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Why are endospores a problem for food safety?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">They survive heat that kills ordinary bacteria.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u3.t.aerobic", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">ae<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">RO<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">bic<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"aerobic\" data-audio=\"audio/aerobic.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: aerobic\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"aerobic\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"28\" width=\"90\" height=\"64\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"51\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Aerobic<\/text><text x=\"51\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"8.834586466165414\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">needs oxygen, as we<\/text><text x=\"51\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">do<\/text><rect x=\"104\" y=\"28\" width=\"90\" height=\"64\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"149\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Anaerobic<\/text><text x=\"149\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">lives without<\/text><text x=\"149\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">oxygen<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">Needing oxygen to live or to make energy.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>需氧的<\/b>：需要氧气才能生存或产生能量。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">aero = air.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">aero = 空气。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Are humans aerobic or anaerobic?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Aerobic.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u3.t.anaerobic", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term mid\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">an<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">ae<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">RO<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">bic<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"anaerobic\" data-audio=\"audio/anaerobic.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: anaerobic\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"anaerobic\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"28\" width=\"90\" height=\"64\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"51\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Anaerobic<\/text><text x=\"51\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">no oxygen needed<\/text><rect x=\"104\" y=\"28\" width=\"90\" height=\"64\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"149\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Example<\/text><text x=\"149\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">bacteria deep in<\/text><text x=\"149\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">mud or the gut<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">Living or working without oxygen.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>厌氧的<\/b>：不需要氧气也能生存或工作。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">an- = without. Without air.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">an- = 没有。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: What does &quot;an-&quot; mean in anaerobic?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Without.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u3.t.decomposer", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term mid\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">de<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">com<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">PO<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">ser<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"decomposer\" data-tts=\"1\" aria-label=\"Listen: decomposer\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><figure class=\"photo\"><img src=\"photos/u3-decomposer.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"533\" alt=\"A rotting apple on the ground. Fungi and bacteria are breaking it down and returning its nutrients to the soil.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">A rotting apple on the ground. Fungi and bacteria are breaking it down and returning its nutrients to the soil.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">地上腐烂的苹果。真菌和细菌正在分解它，把养分还给土壤。<\/span><small class=\"cred\">Photo: Sally V · <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0\" rel=\"license noopener\">CC BY-SA 4.0<\/a> · <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Rotten_apple_under_the_tree.jpg\" rel=\"noopener\">Wikimedia Commons<\/a><\/small><\/figcaption><\/figure><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"decomposer\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"57.9\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Dead<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"69.1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">leaf<\/text><line x1=\"59.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"73.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"73.0,60.0 68.5,62.2 68.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"74\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"52.3\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Bacteria<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"63.5\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">and<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"74.7\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">fungi<\/text><line x1=\"127.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"141.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"141.0,60.0 136.5,62.2 136.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"142\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"168\" y=\"58.05\" font-size=\"9.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Nutrients<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"68.25\" font-size=\"9.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">to soil<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">An organism, such as a bacterium or fungus, that breaks down dead matter and returns nutrients to the soil.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>分解者<\/b>：把死亡有机物分解、将养分还给土壤的生物，如细菌和真菌。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">de- = undo, compose = put together. Take apart.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">de- = 拆开，compose = 组合。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Name two kinds of decomposers.<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Bacteria and fungi.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u3.t.nitrogen-fixation", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term sm\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">NI<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">tro<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">gen<\/span> <span class=\"sy\">fix<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">A<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">tion<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"nitrogen fixation\" data-tts=\"1\" aria-label=\"Listen: nitrogen fixation\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><figure class=\"photo\"><img src=\"photos/u3-nitrogen-fixation.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\" alt=\"Clover roots with small round nodules. Nitrogen-fixing bacteria live inside the nodules.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Clover roots with small round nodules. Nitrogen-fixing bacteria live inside the nodules.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">三叶草根上的小圆根瘤，固氮细菌就住在根瘤里。<\/span><small class=\"cred\">Photo: Sebas11tian · <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0\" rel=\"license noopener\">CC BY-SA 4.0<\/a> · <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Nitrogen_fixing_nodules_in_clover_roots.jpg\" rel=\"noopener\">Wikimedia Commons<\/a><\/small><\/figcaption><\/figure><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"nitrogen fixation\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"57.9\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">N2 gas<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"69.1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">in air<\/text><line x1=\"59.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"73.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"73.0,60.0 68.5,62.2 68.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"74\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"52.3\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Bacteria<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"63.5\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">in soil<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"74.7\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">or roots<\/text><line x1=\"127.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"141.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"141.0,60.0 136.5,62.2 136.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"142\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"168\" y=\"52.3\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Ammonia<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"63.5\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">for<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"74.7\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">plants<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">Bacteria turning nitrogen gas from the air into ammonia that plants can use.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>固氮作用<\/b>：细菌把空气中的氮气转化成植物能利用的氨。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">fix = lock into a usable form.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">fix = 固定成可利用的形式。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Why do plants need nitrogen-fixing bacteria?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Plants cannot use nitrogen gas, but they can use the ammonia the bacteria make.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u3.t.cyanobacteria", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term sm\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">cy<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">a<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">no<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">bac<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">TE<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">ri<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">a<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"cyanobacteria\" data-audio=\"audio/cyanobacteria.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: cyanobacteria\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><figure class=\"photo\"><img src=\"photos/u3-cyanobacteria.webp\" width=\"307\" height=\"480\" alt=\"Anabaena, a chain of cyanobacteria cells, under a microscope. Each cell is only a few micrometres wide.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Anabaena, a chain of cyanobacteria cells, under a microscope. Each cell is only a few micrometres wide.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">显微镜下的鱼腥藻：一串蓝细菌细胞，每个细胞只有几微米宽。<\/span><small class=\"cred\">Photo: Elapied (fr.wikipedia) · <a href=\"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/\" rel=\"license noopener\">CC BY-SA 3.0<\/a> · <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Anabaena_sperica2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener\">Wikimedia Commons<\/a><\/small><\/figcaption><\/figure><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"cyanobacteria\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"52.3\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Sunlight<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"63.5\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">+ CO2 +<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"74.7\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">water<\/text><line x1=\"59.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"73.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"73.0,60.0 68.5,62.2 68.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"74\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"62.275\" font-size=\"6.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Cyanobacteria<\/text><line x1=\"127.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"141.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"141.0,60.0 136.5,62.2 136.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"142\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"168\" y=\"57.9\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Sugar +<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"69.1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">oxygen<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">Photosynthetic bacteria that make their own food from light and release oxygen.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>蓝细菌<\/b>：能进行光合作用、利用光自制食物并释放氧气的细菌。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">cyan = blue-green. Blue-green bacteria.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">cyan = 蓝绿色。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: What gas do cyanobacteria release?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Oxygen.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}], "quiz": [{"id": "cu.q.u3.t.binary-fission", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“How a bacterium reproduces: it copies its DNA, grows, and splits into two identical cells.”<\/i>", "opts": ["viral envelope", "binary fission", "extremophile", "ribosome"], "a": 1, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>binary fission<\/b>: How a bacterium reproduces: it copies its DNA, grows, and splits into two identical cells. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">二分裂<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u3.t.conjugation", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“Two bacteria join by a pilus and pass DNA, such as a plasmid, from one to the other.”<\/i>", "opts": ["plasmid", "microbiome", "conjugation", "vaccine"], "a": 2, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>conjugation<\/b>: Two bacteria join by a pilus and pass DNA, such as a plasmid, from one to the other. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">接合<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u3.t.endospore", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“A tough, dormant form some bacteria make to survive heat, dryness and chemicals.”<\/i>", "opts": ["lysogenic cycle", "conjugation", "endospore", "lytic cycle"], "a": 2, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>endospore<\/b>: A tough, dormant form some bacteria make to survive heat, dryness and chemicals. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">内生孢子<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u3.t.aerobic", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“Needing oxygen to live or to make energy.”<\/i>", "opts": ["capsid", "lytic cycle", "pilus", "aerobic"], "a": 3, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>aerobic<\/b>: Needing oxygen to live or to make energy. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">需氧的<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u3.t.anaerobic", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“Living or working without oxygen.”<\/i>", "opts": ["obligate parasite", "anaerobic", "binary fission", "halophile"], "a": 1, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>anaerobic<\/b>: Living or working without oxygen. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">厌氧的<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u3.t.decomposer", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“An organism, such as a bacterium or fungus, that breaks down dead matter and returns nutrients to the soil.”<\/i>", "opts": ["microorganism", "coccus", "endospore", "decomposer"], "a": 3, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>decomposer<\/b>: An organism, such as a bacterium or fungus, that breaks down dead matter and returns nutrients to the soil. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">分解者<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u3.t.nitrogen-fixation", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“Bacteria turning nitrogen gas from the air into ammonia that plants can use.”<\/i>", "opts": ["extremophile", "vaccine", "lytic cycle", "nitrogen fixation"], "a": 3, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>nitrogen fixation<\/b>: Bacteria turning nitrogen gas from the air into ammonia that plants can use. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">固氮作用<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u3.t.cyanobacteria", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“Photosynthetic bacteria that make their own food from light and release oxygen.”<\/i>", "opts": ["thermophile", "microorganism", "cyanobacteria", "spirillum"], "a": 2, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>cyanobacteria<\/b>: Photosynthetic bacteria that make their own food from light and release oxygen. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">蓝细菌<\/span>", "whys": null